        "name": "preamp_5532",
        "description": "NE5532 dual op‑amp used as a single‑ended low‑noise preamplifier. VCC_P (pin 8) is powered from VIN_9V, VCC_N (pin 4) tied to GND. Differential input pins IN1_P (pin 3) and IN1_N (pin 2) form the audio input; only IN1_P is used in single‑ended mode with IN1_N referenced to GND. Output pin OUT1 (pin 1) provides the amplified audio signal to the power‑amp stage. The second channel (OUT2, IN2_P/N) is unused in this design.",
